<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Hibernian H1 pretax profit 18.4 mln punts.</title>
<headline>Hibernian H1 pretax profit 18.4 mln punts.</headline>
<text>
<p>DUBLIN, July 28 Reuter) - Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		25.5		   vs 17.2</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.5		    vs 3.1</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    18.42		  vs 13.02</p>
<p> Gross written premiums 156.95		 vs 146.18</p>
<p>NOTE - Hibernian Group is an Irish-based insurance group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
